title: 'US Metro Cost of Living Index (BEA RPP) with Median Rent, Home Value, Income & Population for 50 Metros'
authors:
  - name: 'Kultranz (kultranz.com)'
type: dataset
repository-code: 'https://github.com/CodePhantom-1/kultranz-cost-of-living-index'
url: 'https://kultranz.com'
abstract: >-
  BEA Regional Price Parities (all items, US=100) for 50 major US metros,
  combined with median rent, median home value, median income and population
  from the US Census ACS. 2025-26 vintage; no imputed or interpolated values.
keywords:
